  "hash": "5f8ba5d",
  "author": "Haroen Viaene",
  "subject": "feat(ts): allow custom ui state and route state in routing (#4816)",
  "bodyLines": [
    "* feat(ts): allow custom ui state and route state in routing\r",
    "\r",
    "While I couldn't find a way to make InstantSearch itself generic (this gets passed to many places, which then loses generic), using the routing middleware directly is possible like this now\r",
    "\r",
    "```ts\r",
    "import instantsearch from 'instantsearch.js/es'\r",
    "import { history } from 'instantsearch.js/es/lib/routers';\r",
    "import { createRouterMiddleware } from 'instantsearch.js/es/middlewares';\r",
    "import { StateMapping, UiState } from 'instantsearch.js/es/types';\r",
    "\r",
    "type SwagIndexUiState = { swag: boolean };\r",
    "type SwagUiState = { [indexName: string]: SwagIndexUiState };\r",
    "\r",
    "const stateMapping: StateMapping<UiState & SwagUiState, SwagUiState> = {\r",
    "  stateToRoute(uiState) {\r",
    "    return Object.keys(uiState).reduce(\r",
    "      (state, indexId) => ({\r",
    "        ...state,\r",
    "        [indexId]: { swag: uiState[indexId].swag },\r",
    "      }),\r",
    "      {}\r",
    "    );\r",
    "  },\r",
    "\r",
    "  routeToState(routeState = {}) {\r",
    "    return Object.keys(routeState).reduce(\r",
    "      (state, indexId) => ({\r",
    "        ...state,\r",
    "        [indexId]: routeState[indexId],\r",
    "      }),\r",
    "      {}\r",
    "    );\r",
    "  },\r",
    "};\r",
    "\r",
    "const search = instantsearch();\r",
    "\r",
    "search.use(\r",
    "  createRouterMiddleware<UiState & SwagUiState, SwagUiState>({\r",
    "    router: history(),\r",
    "    stateMapping,\r",
    "  })\r",
    ");\r",
    "search.addWidgets([instantsearch.widgets.hits({ container })]);\r",
    "```\r",
    "\r",
    "* actually genericificate InstantSearch\r",
    "\r",
    "* already inferred so no need\r",
    "\r",
    "* Apply suggestions from code review\r",
    "\r",
    "* address feedback\r",
    "\r",
    "* better comment"
  ],
